sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Agent (Narrator/Resolver)
    participant MongoDB as MongoDB (Pending State)
    participant CanonKeeper as CanonKeeper
    participant Neo4j as Neo4j (Canonical Graph)

    Agent->>MongoDB: Registers ProposedChange
    Note over Agent,Neo4j: Scene ends
    CanonKeeper->>MongoDB: Reads accumulated proposals
    CanonKeeper->>CanonKeeper: Evaluates consistency
    alt Is Consistent
        CanonKeeper->>Neo4j: Writes to Canon
    else Contradiction
        CanonKeeper->>MongoDB: Marks as Rejected
    end
